{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/blizzard-new/abroad/pulls/13","id":4818614683,"node_id":"PR_kwDOU62qx88AAAABHzY5mw","html_url":"https://github.com/blizzard-new/abroad/pull/13","diff_url":"https://github.com/blizzard-new/abroad/pull/13.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/blizzard-new/abroad/pull/13.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/blizzard-new/abroad/issues/13","number":13,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"TKU: verified host forms, capture years, and 287-school scope","user":{"login":"blizzard-new","id":262101326,"node_id":"U_kgDOD59ZTg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/262101326?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/blizzard-new","html_url":"https://github.com/blizzard-new","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blizzard-new/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blizzard-new/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blizzard-new/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blizzard-new/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blizzard-new/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blizzard-new/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blizzard-new/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blizzard-new/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/blizzard-new/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"淡江官方姊妹名錄286校，與既有交換名單聯集287校；153筆計畫保留原128筆，另25筆日本第一輪／50名額是已截止歷史。最新日語第二輪4校7名額，2026/9/30中午（Asia/Taipei）母校期限已截止，0筆新開放母校申請。交換期2027/4–2028/3，不預設秋季。其他283校名額維持149尚未核實新版、134參考；協議與接待校incoming條件不產生本期名額。英文組與陸港澳金門116新版仍「尚未核實新版」，沒有改稱官方明示尚未公告。\n\n本輪完成第三次正文、附件及資產續核：\n\n| 項目 / 固定287所 | 第二里程碑 | 本輪 |\n|---|---:|---:|\n| 授權且實際檢視校景 | 264 | 264（全數核實拍攝期，91.99%） |\n| 有來源座標 | 260 | 264（9命名實體點、255代表點） |\n| 官方原文／精讀機構 | 139 | 189 |\n| 精讀正文機構／欄位 | 2 /26 | 20 /151 |\n| 明確来源年期機構／欄位 | 2 /26 | 8 /85（含歷史2026） |\n\n新增18所125個精讀欄位，保存官方URL、PDF實體頁碼或原文、SHA、適用年期與查核時間，全部接待參考不升級為TKU當期資格。一般2350段原文索引與精讀分開。立命館SKP2027春22頁指南／語言條件、長崎NICS2027春8附件、Saar2027/28、UAB/VUB2026/27、津田未載年期與歷史2023課表、土庫交換模板、北航歷史2026國際進修等逐track／學制／科系／校區／年期核對。津田N5為預備日語課豁免條件，不當全員統一門檻；118寮容量不當TKU名額。土庫TOEFL ITP標題／iBT內文、Jan26日期與碩士課年級差異保留待確認。\n\n遼寧原DOC以已安裝LibreOffice實讀為2026博士全學位獎學金，排除交換。土庫及北航DOC用隔離暫存profile、巨集安全3、停用外連更新轉4份PDF共7頁，原DOC／未解析歷史保留；沒有文件互動或提出網路操作，不宣稱量測了網路流量。北航Form004普通進修與體檢PDF實讀，Form005高級進修、Form006語言研修及四年本科10萬／12萬RMB財力表排除；國際General Scholar是否對應TKU陸港澳金門仍未核實。\n\n原264照片重新核對拍攝期，17張未知／矛盾先隱藏，15張找到合格替代；平成國際與巴拿馬拉丁仍隱藏，另新增同塔與UAEMEX合格校景，合計264（53重用、211新素材）。所有舊檔、拒用圖與視覺歷史保留。授權或拍攝年未知不展示。新增CityU Macau氹仔、加拿大York Keele、韓新Cheras、Laurea Leppävaara命名實體點；地圖視窗不當地標，ESIEA Laval官方頁經度矛盾暫不採用，IACT粗點／OMU醫院與高專不可替代。照片校區／代表点／TKU實際分配分開。\n\n實際驗證：\n- 最終選定TKU單元／離線/API、school/regions/fit及CGU/NTPU套件：196 passed、4 skipped、0 failed/errors（87.80秒）；4項為CGU既有Phase C data reviewed跳過。CGU另16、NTPU另11項實際通過，已包含總數。\n- 真實Chromium手機390與桌面1280：2 passed（40.77秒），264圖片全decode、授權／拍攝期及264點通過，無溢出或console錯誤。\n- git diff --check、node --check、OpenAPI export --check通過。\n- CGU3/NTPU12/NTU17/CCU1215/NCU13官方檔逐位元組一致，TKU原4份profile前綴一致；原4校63缺口、18矛盾保留。\n- 僅26個傳輸分片還原4219份捕捉／附件共198,927,161 bytes，分片／11ZIP／每成員SHA與bytes通過。第二里程碑3616檔／7包不變，本輪追加603檔／4包。\n- 本輪初次4失敗後1失敗、修正與156例乾淨執行的歷史XML保留。profile建置命令曾缺PYTHONPATH=src而ModuleNotFoundError，補設定重跑exit0。\n- 沒有本輪全repo全綠宣稱；早期全repo2643 passed／15 skipped／2 failed的historical accounting保留，兩項NTU硬編碼另一session缺失路徑未修改。\n\n2435次接待捕捉歷史：2080個200且無錯誤、355失敗／非200，含重試與離線衍生；不是2435份不同當期文件。126次附件捕捉magic／SHA通過，115唯一URL、114唯一原始SHA；4份離線PDF另列。403／503／429等真實失敗保存，未繞過保護或憑證。\n\n尚缺23照片、23座標，涉及39所，逐校具體查詢結果、錯配／視覺／年份／母體／多校區理由有原文與來源，不概述成「全網沒有」。98所尚無可用官方欄位；20所69未讀候選另列（39目錄、9事件／人物、10疑似全學位招生、6歷史教材、5計畫範圍待讀），不當申請條件或官方未公告。287×22＝6314欄完整度與283校本期名額仍待核實，不宣稱資料全完整。\n\n本輪production變更只限TKU獨立tku_assets.py與tku-campus-assets.js（拍攝期展示門檻、原NICS profile附12接待參考段），校別資料／爬取／離線解析／驗收獨立。本輪沒有新增共用核心修改。整份PR相對main必要共用界面：api.py、school_content.py、static/index.html、static/regions.js、docs/api/openapi.json，以及test_fit_signals.py／test_school_completeness.py數量斷言；registry／共用eligibility/documents/models沒有新增本期規則，供主session統一合併。\n\n交付：\n- [完整報告及逐校缺口](https://github.com/blizzard-new/abroad/blob/563fb9328c7ce15efc1ac3883d8c3d641df01e98/docs/tku-continuation-milestone3-20261011.md)\n- [機讀结果](https://github.com/blizzard-new/abroad/blob/563fb9328c7ce15efc1ac3883d8c3d641df01e98/docs/tku-continuation-milestone3-20261011.json)\n- [JUnit、畫面與pack-only證據雜湊清單](https://github.com/blizzard-new/abroad/blob/563fb9328c7ce15efc1ac3883d8c3d641df01e98/docs/tku-census-evidence-20261011/milestone3-evidence-manifest.json)\n\n已推送commit **563fb9328c7ce15efc1ac3883d8c3d641df01e98**，tree **1551720089e5d792e1830f5b905554493f82dfe6**；git ls-remote與PR head一致，main仍59a20f27fcee00fb597abc79e75ec11778317422。獨立分支data/tku-completeness-20261011；僅更新此Draft，未merge、部署或更動他校session、憑證、權限與安全設定。","created_at":"2026-10-11T11:09:23Z","updated_at":"2026-10-11T15:04:27Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"89727e4498f0408b95f73da58e2874e4189f196e","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/blizzard-new/abroad/pulls/13/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/blizzard-new/abroad/pulls/13/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/blizzard-new/abroad/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/blizzard-new/abroad/issues/13/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/blizzard-new/abroad/statuses/563fb9328c7ce15efc1ac3883d8c3d641df01e98","head":{"label":"blizzard-new:data/tku-completeness-20261011","ref":"data/tku-completeness-20261011","sha":"563fb9328c7ce15efc1ac3883d8c3d641df01e98","user":{"login":"blizzard-new","id":262101326,"node_id":"U_kgDOD59ZTg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/262101326?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/blizzard-new","html_url":"https://github.com/blizzard-new","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/user